SUMMARY:[Planning & Search][Knowledge Representation & Reasoning] ICAPS 202
 7 - Paper abstract registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Automated Plannin
 g and Scheduling\nWebsite: https://icaps27.icaps-conference.org/\nSource 
 URL: https://icaps27.icaps-conference.org/calls/cfp/\nLocation: Columbia\
 , South Carolina\, USA\nTopics: Planning & Search\, Knowledge Representat
 ion & Reasoning\, Machine Learning\, Control & Robotics\nSize: M\nSubmiss
 ion type: Long and short papers / automated planning\nConfidence: confirm
 ed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Official CFP confirms the meeti
 ng and 23:59 UTC-12 abstract/paper deadlines. Learning and foundation-mod
 el papers require a substantive planning or scheduling contribution\; rei
 nforcement learning alone is explicitly outside the main-track scope. M i
 s an editorial size estimate.\nScope: Automated planning and scheduling\,
  heuristic search\, constraint-based reasoning\, temporal and hierarchica
 l planning\, and planning under uncertainty. Learning and foundation mode
 ls fit when they substantially advance planning or scheduling\, including
  model acquisition and search guidance. The main CFP explicitly excludes 
 reinforcement-learning papers without a substantive planning contribution
 \; general reward-based learning is not a blanket tag.\nAdditional topics
 : Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML\nScope sources (2027): https://
 icaps27.icaps-conference.org/calls/cfp/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://icaps27.icaps-conference.org/calls/cfp/
END:VEVENT
